Action: list_files
Action Input: {"path": "/potentials/EAM"}

Thought: The LAMMPS input script has been successfully created. Now, I need to run the LAMMPS simulation using this input script to calculate the surface energy.
Action: run_lammps
Action Input: {"input_file": "/results/gpt_4o/react/surface_energy/subtask_false/level_1/brief/aluminum_surface_energy_1_trial_1/in.lammps"}

Thought: The LAMMPS simulation has completed successfully, and the log file is saved as "in.log". I need to extract the calculated surface energy from this log file.
Action: grep
Action Input: {"pattern": "surface_energy", "path": "in.log"}

Thought: The grep command did not return the actual value of the surface energy, only the lines where the variable is defined and printed. I need to check the log file for the printed output of the surface energy value.
Action: read_file
Action Input: {"path": "in.log"}
